From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: musa <musa@local>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] MUSA: gitignore torchada-generated _musa dirs

torchada generates MUSA source mirrors next to the upstream CUDA dirs (e.g. csrc/moe -> csrc/moe_musa, csrc/libtorch_stable -> csrc/libtorch_stable_musa) into the vLLM clone at build time. Ignore any *_musa/ directory so these generated sources do not show up as untracked files in third_party/vllm.
---
 .gitignore | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index 26cd21a01..cfafec53f 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -254,3 +254,6 @@ vllm/grpc/vllm_engine_pb2.pyi
 
 # Ignore generated cpu headers 
 csrc/cpu/cpu_attn_dispatch_generated.h
+
+# torchada-generated MUSA source mirrors (e.g. csrc/moe_musa/, csrc/<dir>_musa/)
+*_musa/
